cf-ghost-monster-rules = You are a monster in this encounter. Fight the adventurers.

cf-ghost-giant-rat-name = Giant rat
cf-ghost-giant-rat-desc = A rat the size of a dog. Quick and easily killed, so bite and keep moving.
cf-ghost-boar-name = Boar
cf-ghost-boar-desc = A bristling wild pig with tusks. It takes a lot of killing.
cf-ghost-grizzly-bear-name = Grizzly bear
cf-ghost-grizzly-bear-desc = A huge brown bear, and the strongest of the wild animals.
cf-ghost-giant-frog-name = Giant frog
cf-ghost-giant-frog-desc = A frog as big as a man, with a mouth to match.
cf-ghost-hunting-spider-name = Hunting spider
cf-ghost-hunting-spider-desc = A spider the size of a large dog that runs its prey down.
cf-ghost-sewer-ooze-name = Sewer ooze
cf-ghost-sewer-ooze-desc = A heaving pile of filth. It is slow and easy to hit, but very hard to kill.
cf-ghost-velociraptor-name = Velociraptor
cf-ghost-velociraptor-desc = A quick, feathered hunter, at its best alongside others of its kind.
cf-ghost-kobold-warrior-name = Kobold warrior
cf-ghost-kobold-warrior-desc = A small skirmisher with a spear. Go for enemies who are busy with someone else.
cf-ghost-skeleton-guard-name = Skeleton guard
cf-ghost-skeleton-guard-desc = Old bones with a scimitar, still keeping the post they were given.
cf-ghost-skeleton-archer-name = Skeleton archer
cf-ghost-skeleton-archer-desc = Old bones with a shortbow. When the arrows run out, close in with your claws.
cf-ghost-goblin-warrior-name = Goblin warrior
cf-ghost-goblin-warrior-desc = A goblin with a dogslicer. Fight in a crowd, and stab whoever your friends are already fighting.
cf-ghost-goblin-archer-name = Goblin archer
cf-ghost-goblin-archer-desc = A goblin with a shortbow and ten arrows. Shoot from behind the others, and use your fists when the arrows run out.
cf-ghost-hobgoblin-soldier-name = Hobgoblin soldier
cf-ghost-hobgoblin-soldier-desc = A drilled soldier with a longsword and a shield. Raise your shield before you close in, and hold the line with your allies.
cf-ghost-hobgoblin-archer-name = Hobgoblin archer
cf-ghost-hobgoblin-archer-desc = A drilled soldier with a shortbow and ten arrows, and a longsword at your neck for when they get close.
cf-ghost-wolf-name = Wolf
cf-ghost-wolf-desc = A grey hunter that runs with its pack. Your bite hurts more when two of the pack are already on your prey.
cf-ghost-juvenile-horned-dragon-name = Juvenile horned dragon
cf-ghost-juvenile-horned-dragon-desc = A young dragon, proud of its horns and its learning. You can bite hard, but you would rather be clever, and you will talk to anyone who speaks Draconic.
cf-ghost-zombie-shambler-name = Zombie shambler
cf-ghost-zombie-shambler-desc = A slow corpse with strong hands. You only ever have two actions, so get hold of someone and do not let go.
cf-ghost-plague-zombie-name = Plague zombie
cf-ghost-plague-zombie-desc = A rotting corpse. You are slow, hard to put down, and whoever you hit may catch zombie rot.
cf-ghost-ghoul-stalker-name = Ghoul stalker
cf-ghost-ghoul-stalker-desc = A quick, clever eater of the dead. Bite first, then claw to grab. You can speak, if there is anything worth saying.
cf-ghost-skeletal-champion-name = Skeletal champion
cf-ghost-skeletal-champion-desc = A dead knight with a longsword and a mind of its own. Blades and arrows do little to you. Hammers do more.
cf-ghost-bone-hound-name = Bone hound
cf-ghost-bone-hound-desc = The fast skeleton of a great hound. You do not think. You run things down and bite them.
cf-ghost-shadow-name = Shadow
cf-ghost-shadow-desc = A living shadow that most weapons pass through. Your touch drains strength, so pick the strongest and wear them down.
cf-ghost-giant-bat-name = Giant bat
cf-ghost-giant-bat-desc = A huge bat that finds its prey by sound. Bite, then follow with a wing.
cf-ghost-viper-name = Viper
cf-ghost-viper-desc = A small venomous snake. You are easily killed, and one bite of yours can be enough.
cf-ghost-giant-viper-name = Giant viper
cf-ghost-giant-viper-desc = A great snake whose venom saps the body. Bite the same prey again while the venom is working.
cf-ghost-giant-monitor-lizard-name = Giant monitor lizard
cf-ghost-giant-monitor-lizard-desc = A big lizard with a venomous bite that weakens what it holds.
cf-ghost-dire-wolf-name = Dire wolf
cf-ghost-dire-wolf-desc = A wolf the size of a pony. Your jaws reach a stride away and drag prey down, and you bite harder when the pack is on it.
cf-ghost-giant-tarantula-name = Giant tarantula
cf-ghost-giant-tarantula-desc = A spider as big as a cottage. Fangs with a paralysing venom, a leg that knocks things flat from a stride away, and a spray of hairs.
